{"availability":"available","full":"ShAuRyA-Noodle/aura-on-device","name":"aura-on-device","description":"On-device empathetic AI for Indian Gen Z. Four specialist agents and a Phi-3-mini orchestrator turn phone signals (notifications, UPI SMS, calendar, HRV) into one quiet action a few times a day. Glass-box Reasoning Trace, a user-owned encrypted memory graph, and a hard daily Silence Budget. Nothing leaves the device unless you export it.","category":"Finance","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-07T15:54:53Z","updated":"2026-10-06T10:37:24Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://shaurya-noodle.github.io/aura-on-device/","topics":["digital-wellbeing","edge-ai","fastapi","gradio","ios","langgraph","llm-orchestration","multi-agent","on-device-ai","phi-3","privacy-first","python"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Shaurya-Noodle/Caramel_Coin","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.689Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.689Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.689Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.689Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An on-device empathetic intelligence layer for Indian Gen Z and Gen Alpha. Four specialist agents, one Phi-3-mini orchestrator, a glass-box Reasoning Trace, and a memory graph the user owns.","Aura is a continuous, on-device orchestrator that watches the signals already on a Gen Z phone (notifications, calendar events, UPI SMS, Gmail receipts, HRV, sleep) and turns the four that matter into one quiet action a few times a day. Nothing leaves the device unless the user presses export. Every action ships with a Reasoning Trace the user can read, edit, or reject. Built by Galaxy Brain at Thapar Institute for Samsung EnnovateX 2026, on a total budget of two thousand rupees.","The average Gen Z phone receives 237 notifications a day. Four of them matter. The other 233 are a tax on attention that nobody chose to pay. Existing assistants, from Gemini Live and Apple Intelligence to Bixby, Pixel Assistant, Rabbit, and Humane, start when the user starts. None of them see HRV, none read the WhatsApp project group, none parse a UPI SMS, and none expose a step-by-step trace the user can audit. Aura closes that loop on the device, with five defended product wedges shipped together."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ShAuRyA-Noodle/aura-on-device/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"183626a3d25c99a2f98a666e3d66f9d0628eb2043da87abd525eea1defdc6919","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.806Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.806Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An on-device empathetic intelligence layer for Indian Gen Z and Gen Alpha. Four specialist agents, one Phi-3-mini orchestrator, a glass-box Reasoning Trace, and a memory graph the user owns.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ShAuRyA-Noodle/aura-on-device/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"not_required","text":"No paid Apple Developer Program needed for evaluators.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ShAuRyA-Noodle/aura-on-device/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"183626a3d25c99a2f98a666e3d66f9d0628eb2043da87abd525eea1defdc6919","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ShAuRyA-Noodle/aura-on-device/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.806Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T10:37:24Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ShAuRyA-Noodle/aura-on-device/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:44.807Z","hash":"183626a3d25c99a2f98a666e3d66f9d0628eb2043da87abd525eea1defdc6919","originalBytes":8861,"storedBytes":8861,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","aura","orchestrator","reasoning","trace","user","action","brain","five","four","galaxy","gen","ios","memory","agents","apple","architecture","budget","hrv","license","none","on-device","one","pilot","thapar","t